<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoInstallMathFunctions"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoInstallMathFunctions</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoInstallMathFunctions</function></refname>
  <refpurpose></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Math.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">bool SilikoInstallMathFunctions(SilikoEngine *destination);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>

<para>The <function>SilikoInstallMathFunctions</function> function
installs the functions supporting the C <filename>math.h</filename>
functions into <varname>destination</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoInstallMathFunctions</function> returns
<literal>true</literal> if all functions were installed successfully,
<literal>false</literal> otherwise. If <literal>false</literal>  was
returned, then the selection of functions installed in the
<type>SilikoEngine</type> object is unspecified.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
